message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "ct-xai-qc: a quality-control protocol for saliency-based explanations in CT"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible evaluation of saliency-based explanations for CT image
  classification under physics-based simulation of acquisition and
  reconstruction changes: faithfulness, stability under acquisition shift and
  sanity checks.
